11. For all what has been discussed hereinabove, the petitioner is admitted to bail subject to following conditions:
(i) That he shall furnish bail bond in the amount of Rs. 50,000/ with one surety of the like amount to the satisfaction of the trial court;
(ii) That he shall appear before the learned trial court on each and every date of hearing till the conclusion of the trial ;
(iii) That he shall not leave the territorial limits of Union Territory of J&K without prior permission of the learned trial.
12.

